# System formulae (bash, git, zsh, openssl@3, pkgconf) and the mas CLI are managed by mise via [bootstrap.packages] (config.toml + config.macos.toml).
# This file is GUI casks only —
# each entry stays on Homebrew for its own reason (checked against mise 2026.6.13):
#
# - claude: mise's brew-cask backend copies app bundles by dereferencing their internal symlinks,
#   which rewrites the bundle layout and breaks the code-signature seal —
#   a signed Electron app then fails Gatekeeper as "damaged".
#   brew installs via ditto + quarantine clearing, keeping the bundle intact.
#   Revisit if mise switches install_app to a symlink-preserving copy.
# - tailscale-app: a pkg cask that mise can now install
#   (pkg + pkgutil-receipt support landed in #10587),
#   but not yet migrated.

# macOS only
if OS.mac?
    cask "claude"
    cask "tailscale-app"
end
